# fixedbugs, defect 156, lane land186, 2026-10-02 (panel 186 R5), a shape
# beside the critic's: the bit-fields sit in an anonymous struct, promoted to
# `INANON`'s own names. One named is refused on its line; the one left out is
# told as a bit-field, left to `partial`. Before, the trunk's probe named the
# anonymous struct itself in the message, `struct INANON::(anonymous at ...)`,
# clang's text and no name the author can write.

extern "fixedbugs-156-bit-fields.h"
    record INANON  #~ ffi_incomplete_record
        kind: i32
        lo: u8  #~ ffi_field_type

function touch(v: INANON) -> i32
    return v.kind

function main()
    print(1)
